# Contact form — hosted by Formspree (free plan: 50 messages/month).
#
# 1. Create a form at https://formspree.io with samuel.isip26@gmail.com as the recipient.
# 2. Copy its endpoint (https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxx) below.
# 3. Local dev: copy this file to `.env`. Cloudflare: add the same variable under
#    Settings → Variables (build) of the project, then redeploy.
#
# This value is public (it ends up in the page HTML); it is not a secret.
# Without it the form still validates, and submitting points visitors to your email.
PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
